{
  "declaredLength": 2688,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 강해지기를 원하시는 거죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020AC15D574C9C0AE30B97C0020C6D0D558C2DCB2940020AC70C8E0003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나 자신을 위해서다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0980020C790C2E0C7440020C704D574C11CB2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 강해지기를 원하는 이유는\n무쿠를 지키기 위해,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그리고 모두를 지키기 위해서입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020AC15D574C9C0AE30B97C0020C6D0D558B2940020C774C720B294000ABB34CFE0B97C0020C9C0D0A4AE300020C704D574002C00100001BE00000AADF8B9ACACE00020BAA8B450B97C0020C9C0D0A4AE300020C704D574C11CC785B2C8B2E4002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "확실히 나는\n여전히 유카리를 이기지 못한 상태야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D655C2E4D7880020B098B294000AC5ECC804D7880020C720CE74B9ACB97C0020C774AE30C9C00020BABBD55C0020C0C1D0DCC57C002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 그 역경이 나를 강하게 해 주고 있어.\n왜냐하면 나에게는 신념이 있기 때문이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020ADF80020C5EDACBDC7740020B098B97C0020AC15D558AC8C0020D5740020C8FCACE00020C788C5B4002E000AC65CB0D0D558BA740020B098C5D0AC8CB2940020C2E0B150C7740020C788AE300020B54CBB38C774C57C002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유카리를 뛰어넘을 수만 있으면\n나는 누구에게도 지지 않을 테니까!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그 경지에 이를 때까지 계속 싸울 뿐이라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720CE74B9ACB97C0020B6F0C5B4B118C7440020C218B9CC0020C788C73CBA74000AB098B2940020B204AD6CC5D0AC8CB3C40020C9C0C9C00020C54AC7440020D14CB2C8AE4C002100100001BE00000AADF80020ACBDC9C0C5D00020C774B97C0020B54CAE4CC9C00020ACC4C18D0020C2F8C6B80020BFD0C774B77CACE0002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오로지 자신만을 위해서 싸우시는군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B85CC9C00020C790C2E0B9CCC7440020C704D574C11C0020C2F8C6B0C2DCB294AD70C694002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 트레이너로서\n그게 과연 올바른 생각일까요!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108B85CC11C000AADF8AC8C0020ACFCC5F00020C62CBC14B9780020C0DDAC01C77CAE4CC6940021003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빨리 와 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE68B9AC0020C6400020BD10002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너를 투입시켜서\n이 싸움을 끝내야겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B97C0020D22CC785C2DCCF1CC11C000AC7740020C2F8C6C0C7440020B05DB0B4C57CACA0C5B4002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003> 왔으니까\n누가 옳은지는 승부로 정하도록 해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000030020C654C73CB2C8AE4C000AB204AC000020C633C740C9C0B2940020C2B9BD80B85C0020C815D558B3C4B85D0020D574002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강해지기를 원한다면\n역시 말보다는 싸움이지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D574C9C0AE30B97C0020C6D0D55CB2E4BA74000AC5EDC2DC0020B9D0BCF4B2E4B2940020C2F8C6C0C774C9C0002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! 나의 신념을 증명하기 위해\n같이 저스티스회와 싸워 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000210020B098C7580020C2E0B150C7440020C99DBA85D558AE300020C704D574000AAC19C7740020C800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC6400020C2F8C6CC0020C918002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시합은 저도 바라던 바입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCD569C7400020C800B3C40020BC14B77CB3580020BC14C785B2C8B2E4002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "돌아가고 싶으니까\n승부해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3CCC544AC00ACE00020C2F6C73CB2C8AE4C000AC2B9BD80D5740020C918002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강한 상대를 이겨야만\n얻을 수 있는 경험이 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D55C0020C0C1B300B97C0020C774ACA8C57CB9CC000AC5BBC7440020C2180020C788B2940020ACBDD5D8C7740020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "힘이야말로 파워!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D798C774C57CB9D0B85C0020D30CC6CC0021002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의외로 우유부단하구나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C758C678B85C0020C6B0C720BD80B2E8D558AD6CB098003F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "힘이야말로 저스티스!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D798C774C57CB9D0B85C0020C800C2A4D2F0C2A40021002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! 나의 신념을 증명하기 위해\n같이 저스티스회와 싸워 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000210020B098C7580020C2E0B150C7440020C99DBA85D558AE300020C704D574000AAC19C7740020C800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC6400020C2F8C6CC0020C918002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대여르! 메가진화로\n저스티스를 드높여 승리하는 겁니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300C5ECB97400210020BA54AC00C9C4D654B85C000AC800C2A4D2F0C2A4B97C0020B4DCB192C5EC0020C2B9B9ACD558B2940020AC81B2C8B2E4002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "샹델라...\n메가진화로 쓰러뜨리자.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0F9B378B77C002E002E002E000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020C4F0B7ECB728B9ACC790002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 비장의 카드!\n드래캄! 메가진화로 날뛰어 보자고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020BE44C7A5C7580020CE74B4DC0021000AB4DCB798CE8400210020BA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020B0A0B6F0C5B40020BCF4C790ACE0002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자신을 위한 싸움...\n타인을 위한 싸움...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C2E0C7440020C704D55C0020C2F8C6C0002E002E002E000AD0C0C778C7440020C704D55C0020C2F8C6C0002E002E002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "둘 사이에 우열 같은 건 없고,\n가려서도 안 되는 것 같네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4580020C0ACC774C5D00020C6B0C5F40020AC19C7400020AC740020C5C6ACE0002C000AAC00B824C11CB3C40020C5480020B418B2940020AC830020AC19B124C694002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래! 네가 남을 지키기 위해\n도달한 경지도 분명 굉장할 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B79800210020B124AC000020B0A8C7440020C9C0D0A4AE300020C704D574000AB3C4B2ECD55C0020ACBDC9C0B3C40020BD84BA850020AD49C7A5D5600020AC70C57C002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감동적인 승부였습니다!\n부디 이 의상을 받아 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10B3D9C801C7780020C2B9BD80C600C2B5B2C8B2E40021000ABD80B5140020C7740020C758C0C1C7440020BC1BC5440020C8FCC138C694002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미안, 유카리에게서 자유로워질 때까지\n이 옷만을 입기로 약속했거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8C548002C0020C720CE74B9ACC5D0AC8CC11C0020C790C720B85CC6CCC9C80020B54CAE4CC9C0000AC7740020C637B9CCC7440020C785AE30B85C0020C57DC18DD588AC70B4E0002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알겠습니다.\n그럼, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨에게 드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E000AADF8B7FC002C002000100002010000000020C528C5D0AC8C0020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 다른 색의\n시로 코디 도복 세트를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000010020B2E4B9780020C0C9C758000AC2DCB85C0020CF54B5140020B3C4BCF50020C138D2B8B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "영문을 모르겠지만 요즘 시로의\n헤어스타일을 따라 하는 사람도 있대.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C601BB38C7440020BAA8B974ACA0C9C0B9CC0020C694C9980020C2DCB85CC758000AD5E4C5B4C2A4D0C0C77CC7440020B530B77C0020D558B2940020C0ACB78CB3C40020C788B300002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강함에는 끝이 없습니다.\n기회가 되면 또 승부해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D568C5D0B2940020B05DC7740020C5C6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E000AAE30D68CAC000020B418BA740020B6100020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나보다는 시온이\n도장에 더 잘 어울릴지도...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
